    "skillNameTexts": {
      "en": "Sprouting Core",
      "zh-CN": "芽生炉心"
    },
    "skillDescriptionsByRefine": {
      "1": {
        "en": "Increases CRIT Rate by 15%. When the equipper deals DMG with a Basic Attack or EX Special Attack, they gain 1 stack of a buff. Each stack increases the equipper's Electric DMG by 12.5%, up to 2 stacks. Each stack lasts 40s. The duration of each stack is calculated separately. Can trigger once per use of a skill. At 2 stacks, the wearer's Basic Attack and Ultimate DMG ignore 20% of enemy DEF.",
        "zh-CN": "暴击率提升15%；装备者的[普通攻击]、[强化特殊技]造成伤害时，可分别获得1层增益效果，每层增益效果使装备者造成的电属性伤害提升12.5%，最多叠加2层，持续40秒，每层效果单独结算持续时间，同一招式内最多触发一次；拥有2层增益效果时，装备者的[普通攻击]和[终结技]对敌人造成的伤害无视20%防御力。"
      },
      "2": {
        "en": "Increases CRIT Rate by 17%. When the equipper deals DMG with a Basic Attack or EX Special Attack, they gain 1 stack of a buff. Each stack increases the equipper's Electric DMG by 14.5%, up to 2 stacks. Each stack lasts 40s. The duration of each stack is calculated separately. Can trigger once per use of a skill. At 2 stacks, the wearer's Basic Attack and Ultimate DMG ignore 23% of enemy DEF.",
        "zh-CN": "暴击率提升17%；装备者的[普通攻击]、[强化特殊技]造成伤害时，可分别获得1层增益效果，每层增益效果使装备者造成的电属性伤害提升14.5%，最多叠加2层，持续40秒，每层效果单独结算持续时间，同一招式内最多触发一次；拥有2层增益效果时，装备者的[普通攻击]和[终结技]对敌人造成的伤害无视23%防御力。"
      },
      "3": {
        "en": "Increases CRIT Rate by 19%. When the equipper deals DMG with a Basic Attack or EX Special Attack, they gain 1 stack of a buff. Each stack increases the equipper's Electric DMG by 16.5%, up to 2 stacks. Each stack lasts 40s. The duration of each stack is calculated separately. Can trigger once per use of a skill. At 2 stacks, the wearer's Basic Attack and Ultimate DMG ignore 26% of enemy DEF.",
        "zh-CN": "暴击率提升19%；装备者的[普通攻击]、[强化特殊技]造成伤害时，可分别获得1层增益效果，每层增益效果使装备者造成的电属性伤害提升16.5%，最多叠加2层，持续40秒，每层效果单独结算持续时间，同一招式内最多触发一次；拥有2层增益效果时，装备者的[普通攻击]和[终结技]对敌人造成的伤害无视26%防御力。"
      },
      "4": {
        "en": "Increases CRIT Rate by 21%. When the equipper deals DMG with a Basic Attack or EX Special Attack, they gain 1 stack of a buff. Each stack increases the equipper's Electric DMG by 18.5%, up to 2 stacks. Each stack lasts 40s. The duration of each stack is calculated separately. Can trigger once per use of a skill. At 2 stacks, the wearer's Basic Attack and Ultimate DMG ignore 29% of enemy DEF.",
        "zh-CN": "暴击率提升21%；装备者的[普通攻击]、[强化特殊技]造成伤害时，可分别获得1层增益效果，每层增益效果使装备者造成的电属性伤害提升18.5%，最多叠加2层，持续40秒，每层效果单独结算持续时间，同一招式内最多触发一次；拥有2层增益效果时，装备者的[普通攻击]和[终结技]对敌人造成的伤害无视29%防御力。"
      },
      "5": {
        "en": "Increases CRIT Rate by 23%. When the equipper deals DMG with a Basic Attack or EX Special Attack, they gain 1 stack of a buff. Each stack increases the equipper's Electric DMG by 20%, up to 2 stacks. Each stack lasts 40s. The duration of each stack is calculated separately. Can trigger once per use of a skill. At 2 stacks, the wearer's Basic Attack and Ultimate DMG ignore 32% of enemy DEF.",
        "zh-CN": "暴击率提升23%；装备者的[普通攻击]、[强化特殊技]造成伤害时，可分别获得1层增益效果，每层增益效果使装备者造成的电属性伤害提升20%，最多叠加2层，持续40秒，每层效果单独结算持续时间，同一招式内最多触发一次；拥有2层增益效果时，装备者的[普通攻击]和[终结技]对敌人造成的伤害无视32%防御力。"
      }
